cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "synesis-graph: Graph pipeline for the Synesis ecosystem"
abstract: >
  synesis-graph is the graph integration layer of the Synesis ecosystem. It
  converts compiled Synesis knowledge structures into graph representations
  through pluggable backends — Neo4j and ArcadeDB property graphs (with graph
  metrics) and self-contained interactive HTML visualizations — enabling
  GraphRAG, Cypher queries, MCP agent access, and graph-based knowledge
  exploration over qualitative research corpora. ArcadeDB additionally
  supports local vector embeddings for semantic search alongside its
  full-text index.
  Licensed under AGPL-3.0-only with the Synesis Data-Output Exception; outputs generated by this software are not covered by the AGPL (see LICENSE.exception).
